---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactButton from '../components/ContactButton.astro';
---

<Layout title="Bio | Chef Gurbaj">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-heading mb-8 border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-grey/20 pb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#b38b1d] via-[#f8e192] to-[#b38b1d] dark:from-[#d4af37] dark:via-[#f8e192] dark:to-[#d4af37] bg-[length:200%_auto] bg-clip-text text-transparent animate-gradient-wave">
      The <span class="italic">Journey</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12">
      <div class="prose dark:prose-invert prose-p:text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey prose-headings:text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white max-w-none lg:w-2/3">
        <p class="text-xl font-light leading-relaxed mb-12">
          I am a high-performing Executive Chef offering deep restaurant experience. 
          My talent lies in building streamlined, cohesive teams and maintaining absolute focus and productivity 
          in high-volume, fast-paced operations. From sourcing premium ingredients to controlling budgets and 
          boosting restaurant profiles, I am dedicated to creating seamless, unforgettable dining experiences.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading text-saffron-gold mt-12 mb-6">Professional Experience & Industry Expertise</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey">
          <p>Worked with <strong class="text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white font-medium">Tim Hortons</strong>, gaining extensive experience in large-scale food production, product development, and operational excellence.</p>
          <p>Specialized in <strong class="text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white font-medium">Frozen Food Research & Development</strong>, focusing on recipe formulation, processing techniques, and shelf-life optimization. Developed products with a 6-month frozen shelf life by understanding critical factors such as ingredient functionality, temperature control, freezing methods, packaging, food safety, and quality preservation.</p>
          <p>Hands-on experience in <strong class="text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white font-medium">industrial bakery manufacturing</strong>, working on high-volume bread production lines with a capacity of over 100,000 breads per day, ensuring consistency, efficiency, and quality control throughout the production process.</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading text-saffron-gold mt-16 mb-6">Industry Partnerships & Brand Experience</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey mb-6">Worked closely with leading global food ingredient and beverage solution brands, including:</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-6">
          <div class="bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 p-4 rounded-sm text-center font-heading tracking-widest uppercase text-sm md:text-base">Monin</div>
          <div class="bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 p-4 rounded-sm text-center font-heading tracking-widest uppercase text-sm md:text-base">NewTaste</div>
          <div class="bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 p-4 rounded-sm text-center font-heading tracking-widest uppercase text-sm md:text-base">DaVinci Gourmet</div>
          <div class="bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 p-4 rounded-sm text-center font-heading tracking-widest uppercase text-sm md:text-base">Chattha Foods</div>
          <div class="bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 p-4 rounded-sm text-center font-heading tracking-widest uppercase text-sm md:text-base">Vista Processed Foods</div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey">This collaboration involved product innovation, ingredient application, menu development, and commercial food production.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading text-saffron-gold mt-16 mb-6">Retail & FMCG Product Development</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey mb-4">Experienced in developing and commercializing retail food products, including:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey space-y-2 mb-6">
          <li>Frozen and ready-to-cook products</li>
          <li>Ready-to-eat food solutions</li>
          <li>Packaged bakery products</li>
          <li>Shelf-life optimization</li>
          <li>Packaging development and product commercialization</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading text-saffron-gold mt-16 mb-6">Equipment & Production Expertise</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey mb-4">Extensive hands-on experience with commercial and industrial food service equipment, including:</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="border-l-2 border-saffron-gold pl-4 py-2"><span class="font-semibold text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white">Rational Combi Ovens</span></div>
          <div class="border-l-2 border-saffron-gold pl-4 py-2"><span class="font-semibold text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white">UNOX Ovens</span></div>
          <div class="border-l-2 border-saffron-gold pl-4 py-2"><span class="font-semibold text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white">Hoshizaki Refrigeration</span></div>
          <div class="border-l-2 border-saffron-gold pl-4 py-2"><span class="font-semibold text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white">Thermomix</span></div>
          <div class="border-l-2 border-saffron-gold pl-4 py-2"><span class="font-semibold text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white">Robot Coupe</span></div>
          <div class="border-l-2 border-saffron-gold pl-4 py-2"><span class="font-semibold text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white">Elanpro Solutions</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey">Strong understanding of equipment selection, workflow planning, production efficiency, and kitchen optimization.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading text-saffron-gold mt-16 mb-6">Packaging & Takeaway Product Development</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey mb-4">Experienced in designing and developing takeaway and delivery-focused products, including:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey space-y-2 mb-6">
          <li>Coffee cups and beverage packaging</li>
          <li>Food packaging boxes and containers</li>
          <li>Delivery-friendly product development</li>
          <li>Packaging functionality and customer experience</li>
          <li>Product presentation while maintaining food quality during transport</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey italic">Possess a comprehensive understanding of integrating product development, packaging, operations, and manufacturing to create scalable, commercially successful food concepts for cafés, QSRs, restaurants, retail, and industrial food production.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading text-saffron-gold mt-16 mb-6">Consultation Projects</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="border border-saffron-gold/30 p-4 rounded-sm text-center">
            <div class="font-heading tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Mara Coffee</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey uppercase">Bangalore</div>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-saffron-gold/30 p-4 rounded-sm text-center">
            <div class="font-heading tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Dupion</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey uppercase">Jaipur</div>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-saffron-gold/30 p-4 rounded-sm text-center">
            <div class="font-heading tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Cabami</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey uppercase">Varanasi</div>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-saffron-gold/30 p-4 rounded-sm text-center">
            <div class="font-heading tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Fika</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey uppercase">Goa</div>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-saffron-gold/30 p-4 rounded-sm text-center">
            <div class="font-heading tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Fixcabami</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey uppercase">Goa</div>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-saffron-gold/30 p-4 rounded-sm text-center">
            <div class="font-heading tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Minimalist Hotel</div>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-saffron-gold/30 p-4 rounded-sm text-center">
            <div class="font-heading tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Hideon Cafe</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey uppercase">Amritsar</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading text-saffron-gold mt-16 mb-6">Education</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white block">Bachelors In Culinary Arts</strong>
            <span class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey">Queen Margrate University, Edinburg, Navi Mumbai</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-16 text-center lg:text-left">
          <ContactButton text="Get In Touch" intent="general" />
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Cinematic Image Side Panel -->
      <div class="hidden lg:block lg:w-1/3">
        <div class="sticky top-24 reveal">
          <div class="relative overflow-hidden elite-glass rounded-sm shadow-2xl p-2">
            <img src="/images/cafe_raw_materials_1785772861508.jpg" alt="Premium Cafe Ingredients" class="w-full h-[600px] object-cover rounded-sm grayscale dark:grayscale-0" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-obsidian-black/80 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6">
              <p class="text-saffron-gold font-heading text-xl italic m-0">"Respect the ingredient."</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
